        "original_id": "5797d374-0781-5ae6-9b60-abbe5be80431",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: DeVry University, Chicago Public Schools\n- Places: Chicago, Illinois\n- Educational institutions: DeVry Advantage Academy\n- Programs: dual degree high school program, associate degree tracks\n\nFacts:\n- DeVry University was founded in 1931 as DeForest Training School.\n- DeVry University officially became DeVry University in 2002.\n- DeVry University is an American for-profit college.\n- DeVry Advantage Academy is a 2-year dual degree high school in Chicago, Illinois.\n- DeVry Advantage Academy is operated through a partnership between Chicago Public Schools and DeVry University.\n- DeVry Advantage Academy offers students a high school diploma and an associate degree.\n- DeVry Advantage Academy offers associate degree options in Networking System Administration and Web Graphic Design.",
